@startuml stm_lighting
title State machine - Lighting system operating states incl. safe state (SG-01)

[*] --> Init : ignition on
state Init : self-test of sense chain,\nwatchdog and driver stages
state Normal_Operation : all lighting functions available
state Degraded : partial failure detected,\nremaining channels active
state "Safe state: limp-home" as SAFE #LightBlue
state Sleep : ignition off,\nquiescent current <= 1 mA

Init --> Normal_Operation : self-test passed
Init --> SAFE : self-test failed
Normal_Operation --> Degraded : SM-01 reports open load\n(t <= 80 ms)
Degraded --> SAFE : fault reaction complete\n(t <= 230 ms < FTTI 300 ms)
SAFE --> Normal_Operation : fault cleared &&\nignition OFF/ON
Normal_Operation --> Sleep : ignition off + run-on time
Sleep --> Init : ignition on
Normal_Operation --> SAFE : watchdog not served\nwithin 50 ms (TSR-001)

note right of SAFE
  Safe state is degraded but visible:
  remaining channel active at reduced
  power, driver warning active, DTC set.
  "Lights off" would be the hazard.
end note
@enduml
